# Untitled

Full-scale chemical and field-effect passivation: \(21.52\%\) efficiency of stable MAPbI\(_3\) solar cells via benzenamine modification
Fengyou Wang\(^{1,2,3}\), Meifang Yang\(^{1,3}\), Yuhong Zhang\(^{1,3}\), Jinyue Du\(^{1,3}\), Shuo Yang\(^{4}\), Lili Yang\(^{1,2,3}\), Lin Fan\(^{1,2,3}\), Yingrui Sui\(^{1,2,3}\), Yunfei Sun\(^{1}\), and Jinghai Yang\(^{1,2,3}\) (✉)
